# Density Compare
# Nobelium (No) — real density 9.9 g/cm³. equal masses: Nobelium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Nobelium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.3mm color: #00ffa0 at (-20mm, 4.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 79.0 g — the water cube is the reference
